{"title":"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems\">2001 AMC 12 #3</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 10 Problems\">2001 AMC 10 #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The state income tax where Kristin lives is charged at the rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03f019000e7e4e14a3379d05327eb7db704d2897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> of the first\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1022a86171de46c86dd317ad366816e7d7edf63d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 28000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> of annual income plus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/c/82c54da3bbd9f3448135f7866095245ba3c68890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p + 2)\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> of any amount above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1022a86171de46c86dd317ad366816e7d7edf63d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 28000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />. Kristin\nnoticed that the state income tax she paid amounted to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af0e6223309402c06e4e856b92dfe88bdb235f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p + 0.25)\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" /> of her\nannual income. What was her annual income? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2eebd50cfb69848f34ebcbe7add4623808c7500.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\,\\textdollar 28000 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\,\\textdollar 32000 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\,\\textdollar 35000 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\,\\textdollar 42000 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\,\\textdollar 56000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"566\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be Kristin's annual income and the income tax total, respectively. Notice that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a394ead7d83dc9889466a806e206ea2bbdcc9545.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} T &amp;= p\\%\\cdot28000 + (p + 2)\\%\\cdot(A - 28000) \\\\ &amp;= [p\\%\\cdot28000 + p\\%\\cdot(A - 28000)] + 2\\%\\cdot(A - 28000) \\\\ &amp;= p\\%\\cdot A + 2\\%\\cdot(A - 28000) \\end{align*}\" width=\"438\" height=\"68\" />\nWe are also given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/75405b5351821fc58d14290fd4dddf42a77ec4da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[T = (p + 0.25)\\%\\cdot A = p\\%\\cdot A + 0.25\\%\\cdot A\\]\" width=\"329\" height=\"18\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb9c5d80e3f1733bd16e4837f9bcbeb5a8e7150.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p\\%\\cdot A + 2\\%\\cdot(A - 28000) = p\\%\\cdot A + 0.25\\%\\cdot A\\]\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d1025839a18cab02a12511105eb85edae3851ec6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\%\\cdot(A - 28000) = 0.25\\%\\cdot A\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"18\" />\nSolve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/2/b12b6d115c5bd962827d9aae7b8747858d6a6e8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }\\textdollar 32000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p><p>Note: You may also assume p = 0 for easy calculation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/io1JWEGl_J0?si=qa09mILGOdoNM5pc\">https://youtu.be/io1JWEGl_J0?si=qa09mILGOdoNM5pc</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12\" title=\"2001 AMC 12\">2001 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Probl